id: pm-czr31p
title: Reject malformed linked-test JSON paths instead of silently normalizing assertions
description: PR 1263 review found that skipped separators allow result..count to assert result.count. Validate the complete dotted and bracket-index grammar before tokenization; preserve valid own-data traversal. Reproduce and assess the separate TOON-row report without editing tracker storage directly; document touched scanner helper functions.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: correctness,review,testing
