author: "harness:codex"
parent: pm-xxrq
resolution: Reject malformed dotted and bracket-index assertion paths before tokenization; preserve own-data traversal and document scanner contracts.
expected_result: "Malformed assertion metadata fails instead of silently resolving a different JSON field, while valid nested and root-array assertions continue to work."
actual_result: "Eight red-first malformed-path cases now pass; valid nested-array controls, 76 linked tests, temporary Node/Bun CLI acceptance, full static quality and 8972 tests with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage pass."
